	"data": "Bookshelf — Scanning, Sorting, and the XR Slider\n\nType: Room 2.0 Sub-App\nStatus: Spec in progress (handwritten, 2026-09-04)\nSpec Location: Handwritten pages — Bookshelf narrative draft\n\nCore Idea\nThe user's physical bookshelf becomes an interactive spatial interface. Scan it to catalog every item with 3D models, names, and tags. Search by voice for any item — it highlights, and if out of view, a directional indicator guides you. Filter by category and non-matching items dim. Preview…",
